WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:16.890
House of the Dragon, Game of Thrones prequel
series is coming in 2022 on HBO.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:22.070
It’s based on George RR Martin’s book
Fire And Blood volume 1 and on Martin’s

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:27.110
yet unfinished Fire And Blood volume 2 book
which tells the tale of the 300 years long

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:32.500
Targaryen history, starting from Aegon the
Conqueror and ending with the Mad King.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.570
House of the Dragon season 1 will feature
the most exciting time period of the Targaryen

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.760
history, the Targaryen civil war known as
the Dance of the Dragons.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:47.670
The series starts with Viserys Targaryen (played
by actor Paddy Considine) sitting on the Iron

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:50.260
Throne as the King of Westeros.

00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:52.680
His mount - Balerion the Black Dread.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:58.000
King Viserys Targaryen is chosen by the lords
of Westeros to succeed the Old King, Jaehaerys

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.350
Targaryen, at the Great Council at Harrenhal.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:06.350
A warm, kind, and decent man, Viserys only
wishes to carry forward his grandfather’s

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:07.410
legacy.

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:10.810
But good men don’t necessarily make for
great kings.

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:16.180
The King has a famous brother about whom entire
Westeros tells stories, Daemon Targaryen,

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:19.369
the Rogue Prince played by an actor Matt Smith.

00:01:19.369 --> 00:01:24.040
It's George R.R. Martin's favorite Targaryen
known as Prince of the City, Lord Flea Bottom

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:25.240
and the Rogue Prince.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:30.690
He's the most controversial man of his lifetime,
an audacious rogue prince and adventuer who

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.850
seems made of good and evil in equal measure.

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:37.690
Prince Daemon is the most experienced warrior
of his time and wields the Valyrian steel

00:01:37.690 --> 00:01:39.709
blade Dark Sister.

00:01:39.709 --> 00:01:42.300
A dragonrider whose dragon is Caraxes.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:46.170
Writings of Westerosi Archmaester gives the
best description of Daemon.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:52.289
It reads: ''Over the centuries, House Targaryen
has produced both great men and monsters.

00:01:52.289 --> 00:01:53.360
Prince Daemon was both.

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:59.399
In his day there was not a man so admired,
so beloved, and so reviled in all Westeros.

00:01:59.399 --> 00:02:02.129
He was made of light and darkness in equal
parts.

00:02:02.129 --> 00:02:05.899
To some he was a hero, to others the blackest
of villains.''

00:02:05.899 --> 00:02:09.069
King Viserys also has a daughter, Rhaenyra
Targaryen.

00:02:09.069 --> 00:02:13.099
She will be played by an actress Emma D'Arcy.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:17.489
Princess Rhaenyra Targaryen, cheered as the
Realm's Delight is the first-born child of

00:02:17.489 --> 00:02:20.069
King Viserys I Targaryen.

00:02:20.069 --> 00:02:25.769
Rhaenyra was King Viserys I's only living
child by his first wife, Queen Aemma of House

00:02:25.769 --> 00:02:26.849
Arryn.

00:02:26.849 --> 00:02:31.910
At the age of eight she was made her father's
heir and grew up expecting to become the first

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:34.340
ruling Queen of Westeros.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.150
Rhaenyra is a dragonrider whose mount was
Syrax.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:42.040
Rhaenyra and Daemon are together despite the
fact that they are niece and uncle.

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:46.799
Since the King's first wife died, the King
married Alicent Hightower (she's played by

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:47.870
Olivia Cooke).

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:52.939
With her he finally gets male children, the
oldest of which is Aegon.

00:02:52.939 --> 00:02:57.150
But still, Aegon's half sister, Rhaenyra,
is older and even though the king has male

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.840
heirs, Rhaenyra remains the official heir
to the throne.

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:05.909
At first young Rhaenyra and Alicent got along
well, but rift grew between them as soon as

00:03:05.909 --> 00:03:11.859
Alicent produced her own children for Viserys
I, and clearly wanted them to succeed to the

00:03:11.859 --> 00:03:13.970
throne instead of her.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:20.260
Alicent bore Viserys I four children: Aegon
II, Aemond One-Eye, Daeron the Daring, and

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:23.690
Helaena (who became the sister-wife of Aegon
II).

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:30.269
The reason Alicent and Viserys wed was Alicent's
father, Otto Hightower (played by Rhys Ifans)

00:03:30.269 --> 00:03:34.650
who had been Hand of the King in the last
few years of the long reign of King Jaehaerys

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.170
I Targaryen.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:42.610
In 101 AC Otto brought the young Alicent to
the royal court, where she cared for the aging

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.610
king.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:48.400
Jaehaerys eventually died in 103 AC while
Alicent was reading to him and was succeeded

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.129
by his grandson Viserys I.

00:03:51.129 --> 00:03:55.829
The last, but not least of the Targaryens
from this time period, we have Princess Rhaenys

00:03:55.829 --> 00:03:58.560
known among the smallfolk as the Queen Who
Never Was.

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:04.650
She is the granddaughter of Jaehaerys I Targaryen,
and the cousin of Viserys I Targaryen and

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.319
Daemon Targaryen.

00:04:06.319 --> 00:04:11.780
As her father was the Prince of Dragonstone,
and she was his firstborn child, many considered

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:17.120
her as being next in line for the Iron Throne,
but upon quite a few unfortunate events, such

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:20.230
as the death of her father, she was passed
over.

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.570
The great council voted for her cousin Viserys
to be the new King.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:29.670
Rhaenys married legendary Corlys of House
Velaryion, known as the Sea Snake who will

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:34.390
also play a major role in this series, and
he's played by an actor Steve Toussaint.

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:39.530
While the first few episodes will pretty much
be a calm before storm in which we will get

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:43.950
to know all these characters, the second half
of the first season will see the beginning

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:48.780
of the most devastating war Westeros has ever
seen - the Dance of the Dragons.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:54.620
It all starts when King Viserys dies and half
of the kingdom sides with his designated heir

00:04:54.620 --> 00:05:00.700
Rhaenyra while the other half sides with Queen
Alicent who pushes the claim of her son Aegon.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:03.350
We have the Greens against the Blacks.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:07.880
The Greens are the faction that support the
claim of Aegon ll Targaryen, their rivals

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:12.200
being the Blacks, who support the claim of
Rhaenyra Targaryen.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:16.000
Both were named for the color of their clothes
worn during one tourney.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:21.750
The forced closeness of Rhaenyra's and Alicent's
children increased animosity between the blacks

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.090
and the greens.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:28.090
The royal children and grandchildren became
dragonriders and court visitors observed the

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:34.110
dragons of one faction snapping and spitting
flames at the dragons of the other party.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:39.730
Viserys dies in mid-season on the third day
of third moon of 129 AC during a nap in the

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:41.840
Red Keep of King's Landing.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:47.860
On his deathbed, he refuses to change the
succession, and decrees his heir to be Rhaenyra.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:53.720
He's found dead by a servant who first goes
to Alicent to inform her of Viserys's death,

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:59.220
which proves to be a grave mistake as Alicent
proclaims Aegon the King over the wishes of

00:05:59.220 --> 00:06:00.490
Viserys.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:05.330
At the time of her father's death, Rhaenyra
is on Dragonstone as is the place for true

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.410
heir.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:12.000
The greens in King's Landing ensure that the
news of Viserys's death does not reach Rhaenyra

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:16.000
until her own supporters in the Red Keep are
dead or imprisoned

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.340
and Aegon II's coronation had already occurred.

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:23.780
King Viserys decreed Rhaenyra to succeed him
but Aegon the Elder, the eldest son of his

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:29.710
second wife Alicent, is instead crowned Aegon
II by Ser Criston Cole, the Lord Commander

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:30.710
of the Kingsguard.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:35.060
On Dragonstone, Rhaenyra learns about the
death of her father and the betrayal of her

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.060
siblings.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:41.210
Rhaenyra, in answer to Aegon's betrayal is
crowned a queen at Dragonstone and swears

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.430
revenge.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:46.910
This leads to a civil war between Rhaenyra
and Aegon, the Dance of the Dragons.

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:52.770
A war of succession between Aegon II and his
half-sister Rhaenyra over their father Viserys

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:53.770
I's throne.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:58.710
The devastating civil war that tore apart
the Seven Kingdoms.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:04.220
The war lasted for three years, and by the
time it came to an end thousands were dead,

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:09.210
nearly all of the Targaryen dragons had been
killed as well as many Targaryens themselves.

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:15.800
It didn't start outright with war using dragons
and armies, but at first it was a war of ravens.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:19.760
Rhaenyra makes her own council at Dragonstone,
the black council.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:26.460
Participants are, amongst others, her uncle-husband
Daemon, her three eldest sons Jacaerys, Lucerys

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:31.110
and Joffrey, Lord Corlys Velaryon, and his
wife, Princess Rhaenys.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:35.330
During the council it's resolved that while
Rhaenyra remains at Dragonstone to regain

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:40.460
her health, Prince Daemon and Caraxes will
travel to the Riverlands, to make Harrenhal

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:44.520
their base and rallying point for those loyal
to Rhaenyra.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:50.270
House Velaryon will close off the Gullet blocking
all shipping from Blackwater Bay.

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:55.060
Princess Rhaenys is convinced that Storm's
End will declare for Rhaenyra, since Lord

00:07:55.060 --> 00:08:00.200
Boremund Baratheon, the deceased father of
Lord Borros and Rhaenys's uncle, had always

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.590
been a supporter of Rhaenys.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:07.350
Prince Daemon also is convinced that Lady
Jeyne Arryn, the Maiden of the Vale, will

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.930
bring her support to their side.

00:08:09.930 --> 00:08:14.820
Although they believe the north to be too
remote to play an important part in the war,

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:17.950
messages are to be sent to those lords nevertheless.

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:23.790
Rhaenyra's sons themselves depart to rally
the lords to heir side, with the eldest Jacaerys

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:29.140
visiting the Arryns of the Eyrie, the Manderlys
of White Harbor, and the Starks of Winterfell.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:33.500
Rhaenyra's second son, Lucerys, travels to
Storm's End.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:38.229
Prince Daemon leads the first attack of the
war on Harrenhal, which is conquered without

00:08:38.229 --> 00:08:39.229
bloodshed.

00:08:39.229 --> 00:08:44.279
The castellan, Ser Simon Strong, yields when
he sees Daemon's dragon.

00:08:44.279 --> 00:08:49.110
This conquest leads to victories of the blacks
at the Burning Mill and Stone Hedge and allowed

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:52.629
the river lords, such as House Blackwood,
to gather at Harrenhal.

00:08:52.629 --> 00:08:58.660
In the meantime, Jacaerys gains Lady Arryn
and the Lords Manderly, Borrell and Sunderland,

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:03.709
and Cregan Stark to Rhaenyra's cause, with
Cregan allying through the Pact of Ice and

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:04.759
Fire.

00:09:04.759 --> 00:09:08.689
Towards the end of season 1, the first battle
between Targaryens and their dragons will

00:09:08.689 --> 00:09:11.199
occur
which will set the dark tone for the rest

00:09:11.199 --> 00:09:15.450
of the war, filled with blood, fire, revenge
and grief.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:18.360
The Dance over Shipbreaker Bay.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:22.290
Lucerys flies to Storm's End, arriving before
a gathering storm.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:27.060
He finds Prince Aemond One-Eye and his dragon
Vhagar already present

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:33.149
who's there on his brother King Aegon's behalf
to win the Baratheon lord to his side.

00:09:33.149 --> 00:09:38.800
Prince Aemond and Lucerys have bad blood even
prior to this as when they were younger, Lucerys

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.900
took out Aemond's eye with a dagger in a fight.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:47.579
Aemond tries to provoke Lucerys into a fight,
insulting him, calling him a Strong bastard,

00:09:47.579 --> 00:09:51.680
but Lucerys, sworn not to fight, refuses him.

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:57.430
He deliveres his message to Lord Borros Baratheon,
but is refused and told to leave.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:02.839
Lord Baratheon prevents Aemond from attacking
his cousin in the castle, but allows for the

00:10:02.839 --> 00:10:04.579
prince to follow him.

00:10:04.579 --> 00:10:09.459
Mounted on his dragon, Aemond catches up with
Lucerys during a raging storm.

00:10:09.459 --> 00:10:12.540
The fight between the two dragons does not
last long.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:18.009
Vhagar, being five times bigger, has the advantage,
and Arrax falls broken.

00:10:18.009 --> 00:10:20.749
Rhaenyra collapses when learning of Lucerys's
death.

00:10:20.749 --> 00:10:25.999
Prince Daemon, at Harrenhal, sends a raven
to his wife, promising that her son's death

00:10:25.999 --> 00:10:27.870
would be avenged.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:32.709
Using one of his friends from King's Landing,
his former lover and current mistress of whisperers,

00:10:32.709 --> 00:10:39.019
Mysaria who is played by an actress Sonoya
Mizuno, Daemon enlists the help of a former

00:10:39.019 --> 00:10:45.680
serjeant in the City Watch, known now only
as Blood, and a rat-catcher from the Red Keep,

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.550
known now only as Cheese.

00:10:47.550 --> 00:10:52.569
The two sneak into the Red Keep, using secret
tunnels and hidden doors, which brings them

00:10:52.569 --> 00:10:54.579
into the Tower of the Hand.

00:10:54.579 --> 00:10:59.150
There, Queen Alicent is bound and gagged,
and her bedmaid strangled.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:04.529
When Queen Helaena (King Aegon's sister-wife)
and their three children appear, Blood and

00:11:04.529 --> 00:11:09.080
Cheese close the doors and tell Helaena to
choose which of her sons will die.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:14.149
Helaena reluctantly chooses Maelor because
he is younger, but Blood does the opposite

00:11:14.149 --> 00:11:16.620
and kills the older Prince instead.

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:21.370
The two flee with the prince's head, leaving
the others unharmed and Daemon proves his

00:11:21.370 --> 00:11:26.420
word to Rhaenyra, and they hit back at King
Aegon, a son for a son.

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:31.079
This is the season 1 finale and it sets the
tone for the upcoming seasons filled with

00:11:31.079 --> 00:11:36.379
fire and blood, revenge and grief, deaths
of Targaryens, their dragons and their armies.

00:11:36.379 --> 00:11:41.490
Ramin Djawadi, the composer of Game of Thrones
epic music is back to compose for all these

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.060
epic scenes in House of the Dragon.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:49.379
If you like epic drama series filled not only
with epic battles between armies and dragons,

00:11:49.379 --> 00:11:53.620
but also filled with court politics, betrayals
and everything that made you fall in love

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:57.720
with the world of Westeros in the first place,
then you are going to love this Game of Thrones

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:58.839
prequel.

00:11:58.839 --> 00:12:04.959
House of the Dragon begins filming in about
one month and will premiere in 2022 on HBO.

00:12:04.959 --> 00:12:07.769
Thank you so much for watching, hope you enjoyed
this video and if you did make sure to give

00:12:07.769 --> 00:12:09.339
it a big thumbs upand I hope to see you in
the next one, peace!

